{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/13181","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/13181/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/13181/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/13181/events","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/13181","id":2838025670,"node_id":"I_kwDOFL76Q86pKNXG","number":13181,"title":"Opting out from Vercel ISR not working for paths with rest parameters","user":{"login":"hrabiel","id":17751509,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzUxNTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17751509?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrabiel","html_url":"https://github.com/hrabiel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrabiel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrabiel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrabiel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrabiel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrabiel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrabiel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrabiel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrabiel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrabiel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":4881110053,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q88AAAABIu_UJQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20vercel","name":"pkg: vercel","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to Vercel adapter (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5745388669,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q88AAAABVnOsfQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/triage:%20needs%20triage","name":"triage: needs triage","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Issue needs to be triaged","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-09-02T16:38:06Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T14:07:11Z","closed_at":"2025-02-14T14:07:09Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Astro Info\n\n```block\nAstro                    v4.15.2\r\nNode                     v20.16.0\r\nSystem                   macOS (arm64)\r\nPackage Manager          npm\r\nOutput                   server\r\nAdapter                  @astrojs/vercel/serverless\r\nIntegrations             none\n```\n\n\n### Describe the Bug\n\nAccording to the documentation, Vercel adapter allows to [exclude specific paths from caching with ISR](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/integrations-guide/vercel/#excluding-paths-from-caching). This works correctly for static and dynamic routes with a parameter, but doesn't work with the routes that include [rest parameters](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/routing/#rest-parameters).\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n```js\r\nimport vercel from '@astrojs/vercel/serverless';\r\nimport { defineConfig } from 'astro/config';\r\n\r\n// https://astro.build/config\r\nexport default defineConfig({\r\n  output: 'server',\r\n  adapter: vercel({\r\n    isr: {\r\n      exclude: [\r\n        \"/one\", // works\r\n        \"/excluded/[slug]\", // works\r\n        \"/excluded/[...rest]\", // doesn't work, it's not excluded\r\n      ]\r\n    }\r\n  })\r\n});\r\n\r\n```\n\n### What's the expected result?\n\nAll routes added to the `isr.excluded` Vercel adapter config should be excluded from caching, including those with rest parameters.\n\n### Link to Minimal Reproducible Example\n\nhttps://github.com/hrabiel/astro-vercel-adapter-demo\n\n### Participation\n\n- [X] I am willing to submit a pull request for this issue.","closed_by":{"login":"florian-lefebvre","id":69633530,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjMzNTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69633530?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre","html_url":"https://github.com/florian-lefebvre","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/13181/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/13181/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}